  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the upcoming release of VRChat on the IOS, content creators on the platform now have to contend with 3 separate build targets. While two was already pretty cumbersome, 3 sounds like it would make uploading and maintaining content for all platforms a nightmare. \n\nI suggest a functionality to allow the user to build for all platforms simultaneously. For avatars, this could be done by selecting specific avatar descriptors for the PC, quest, and IOS builds in the SDK build menu. For worlds, the user could select between different scenes for the respective builds. Once these are selected, the user can simply click upload and the SDK will handle swapping between build targets automatically. This would be a marked improvement in content creation because it would be a one and done task that the creator could wait to finish instead of needing to switch targets 3 different times every time they wish to upload.",
